<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>3.  You can view orders in the database based on:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='4' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='93%' list='bullet'/>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Date ordered</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Status of the order</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Who placed the order (Ship To)</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Project the order was placed under</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Supplier (Company)</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Order Number</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>4.  Find the desired order in the view on the right and open it for viewing by double clicking on the order.</run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpFHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='5' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> </run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Pour afficher une ancienne commande ou celle en vigueur :</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1. À partir du menu de gauche, cliquez sur "Toutes les années" pour voir tout les commandes dans la base de donnée ou cliquez sur "Cette AF" pour voir les comandes de l'année fiscal en cours</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
